Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling, Darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sailing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,on the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.09,0:00:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,cobalt blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The clouds float above the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanging out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,just me and you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Our time is now and soon you'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile with all your heart as you go\Npast the problems that await you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your hopes alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.82,0:00:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Never look down upon yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.34,0:00:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just cast a magic spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You will get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Star, twinkle, twinkle rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Fast beats premonition!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:00:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the colors from\Nall the rainbow beams!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.86,0:01:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Star, come with me and we'll go far!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just fallen angels!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shooting arrows into our hopeful dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.42,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.28,0:01:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Twinkle, twinkle rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.84,0:01:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Within the cobalt blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven colors will come to our surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.54,0:01:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Twinkle, twinkle rainbow star!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandon all your worries!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.10,0:01:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your troubles show through\Nthe mirror of your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.02,0:02:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me comfort you, my love!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold your time within my glove!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We sure are fallen angels!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just singing our hearts\Nall out from up above!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Dying, dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy hippo star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.56,0:02:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a crazy hippo star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy hippo star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.62,0:02:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a crazy hippo star!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.64,0:02:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Luffy, since you're my grandson,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't capture you and turn\Nyou over to the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.34,0:02:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.25,0:02:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If I tell them that, I'm sure\Neveryone will understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't put work before family, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.48,0:02:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not an excuse, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say they got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I mostly just came here as\Na favor to Kobe and Helmepo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You boys take your time and\Nchat it up all you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading back to my ship for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.58,0:02:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you're gonna say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.68,0:03:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,At least pretend like you care I'm your\Ngrandpa and you haven't seen me in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy you're leaving all\Nyou've done is yell and hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I still want my grandson to love me\Nyou idiot I'm not as heartless as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.72,0:03:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I see stubbornness runs in\Nthe family and maturity too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That old man blew in and\Nflew out like a storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit the part about dragons\Ncertainly surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I thought my\Nfamily history was odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.48,0:03:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's out front with\NKobe and that other guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to see him too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.76,0:03:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're old friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.26,0:03:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this does bring back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But Luffy's the one who saved Kobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where Nami ran off to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She said something about\Ngetting info from the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.06,0:03:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess she changed her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she went to the\Npool with Kokoro and the...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.48,0:03:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The pool?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.90,0:03:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Galley-La has a company pool in the\Nback for all of its employees to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean Nami's in a swimsuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:03:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I better bring her a drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.00,0:04:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So you guys went over that mountain\Nto get to the Grand Line, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.64,0:04:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean reverse mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we went a different way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's top secret, but there is\Nanother way for the Navy, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to say, they have ships at headquarters\Nthat can sail through the Calm Belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.80,0:04:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How the heck is anyone supposed\Nto get through when the whole
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,ocean there is packed with sea\Nkings as big as battleships?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That place gave us a lot\Nof trouble, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.84,0:04:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The catch is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the hulls of the navy ships\Nthat sail through there
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,have a bunch of sea prism\Nstones strapped to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'll try to explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea prism stones put off the\Nsame energy as the sea itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,so when the fish see the\Nbottoms of the ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The same energy as the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.94,0:04:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, even if they go straight\Nthrough a nest of sea kings,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,the monsters won't attack because\Nthey won't notice anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.85,0:04:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,even if they didn't take the\Nentrance at Reverse Mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.26,0:05:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,they can still slip into the\NGrand Lime without any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Those Navy scientists are\Nreally something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.46,0:05:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep talking, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.57,0:05:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pirate lady, are you going\Nto swim or not? Huh? Huh? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.28,0:05:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you can it for just a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A chance like this\Ndoesn't come very often.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were cool, Pipe Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing for a big, stupid joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to wiretap here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that something you\Nwant to yell out loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy has the greatest inventor\Nin the world working for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.26,0:05:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Dr. Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who came up with this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's only the tip\Nof the iceberg for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.06,0:05:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that Devil Fruits made Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who identified its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He also figured out how they'd\Ntransfer their abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He even developed a way to feed\NDevil Fruits to inanimate objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.18,0:05:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That was his biggest project last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.20,0:05:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it, but\Nthat sounds pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is full of amazing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, if I had never met you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.12,0:06:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd probably still be living\Nin a narrow little world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't know a thing\Nabout the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like forever ago, when you\Nburst out of that barrel on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But who knows how long I would have been
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,swabbing decks for Alvida\Nif you didn't show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.06,0:06:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.36,0:06:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You were on our ship, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that's really funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and the reason you were there in\Nthe first place is even funnier!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna tell me the story, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.44,0:06:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But still I'm glad the\Nvice admiral is looking
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:07:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,out for us that's why\Nwe have to try our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.14,0:07:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what we do\Nso we can pay him back
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.58,0:07:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,someday yeah I'd like to\Npay him back all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Grillo's punches to the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.20,0:07:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been left with that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe not today, but give it some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.31,0:07:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are going back already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stick around for dinner, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.88,0:07:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,At the end of the day,\Nwe're still enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't be too friendly with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if you've\Never heard the name
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,they use for the second\Nhalf of the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.94,0:07:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,At the far reaches of\Nthe ocean is a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that few pirates or\Nmarines have ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They call it the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.88,0:07:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a new era coming\Nand the people who
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.74,0:07:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,can guide it are gathering on those seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.86,0:08:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They say the one who can master those\Nwaters will become King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And I believe that one of these days,\Nyou and I will meet on those waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.52,0:08:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And when that time comes, I'll be even\Nstronger, strong enough to capture you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I promised myself\Nthat I'll keep trying...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Till...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.12,0:08:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Till I become a marine admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.04,0:08:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.74,0:08:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I got carried away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.92,0:08:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.44,0:08:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to dig a hole\Nand bury my head in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.64,0:08:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That was really arrogant of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.14,0:08:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I got worked up after seeing\Nyou again and I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kobe...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you're gonna fight me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you will become that strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:09:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but a marine admiral, next time I\Nsee you, we're going to be stronger too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.46,0:09:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole lot stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.62,0:09:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.40,0:09:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I just blurted out some ridiculous dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.70,0:09:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.61,0:09:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Something I don't even\Nhave a right to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.22,0:09:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But he didn't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He believed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.60,0:09:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out you're still\Na crybaby after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.00,0:09:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, Kobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm truly grateful that I was\Nable to see you again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.22,0:09:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Keeping up with them is going to be a real\Nchallenge I can't kid myself about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.10,0:10:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait we're gonna\Nget tougher and tougher
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll see next time when we\Nall meet in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell hey wait you two\Nbetter prepare yourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,because kobe and I are\Ngonna blow you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me kobe slow\Ndown I can't slow down
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna run all the\Nway to the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What you've lost your mind\Nwell luffy you've done it again
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.80,0:10:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you found another powerful\Nrival for our crew to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If kobe says he can do\Nit then I believe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.42,0:10:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The water water meat is all ready! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Granny, that was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That meat sure smells nice. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.90,0:10:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now say "ah".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.96,0:10:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.62,0:11:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Water, water, meat barbecue!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.32,0:11:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver King, where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.68,0:11:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.16,0:11:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.96,0:11:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you crying for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.68,0:11:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I just got smoke in my eyes, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So how is it, Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice and juicy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.06,0:11:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's heavenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.06,0:11:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat, are you finally awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's your Franky family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here and eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.72,0:11:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Barbecue time, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got too many cars\Nin two little weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to get some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sodom and Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, save some for me! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, over here! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.58,0:11:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.70,0:11:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're out here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:12:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said you could use\Nthe company pool anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.72,0:12:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Put on some clothes! Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never seen a swimsuit before?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, something smells\Ndelicious. Don't look, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This perverted harlot is gonna corrupt\Nyour eyes with her filthy body!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.72,0:12:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Really now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't take a break once\Nwe start building this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we're gonna get all\Nour partying done right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you got a seat set aside for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.44,0:12:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Big Bro's the\Nstar of the show. Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're glad you could make it, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you like to hear\NSniper King's number one hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.58,0:12:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.49,0:12:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Party time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay where you are and listen, Niko-Rom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.88,0:13:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Aokiji?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.86,0:13:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you try to\Nescape like you usually do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.98,0:13:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd acted on your own, you\Ncould have gotten away from CP9.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you should know that\Nthis time was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.78,0:13:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't just abandon my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.08,0:13:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't leave them to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.10,0:13:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You might not know this,\Nbut your friend Jaguar D.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.86,0:13:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,saw that I was forced to kill\NInohara, who was my friend too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I carried out my\Nduty as a Marine that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I also honored his wishes by\Nsparing you and helping you escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, I still felt\Nresponsible for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.62,0:13:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,life but when 20 years\Nhad passed and you still
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.40,0:13:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,hadn't found a home I\Nbegan to fear Sol had made
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,a mistake in the end even\NI had decided you were
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.24,0:14:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,too dangerous to live. I\Nwas certain that Annie's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,lobby would end the\Nstory of Ohara once and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,for all Of course I never\Nanticipated that Straw
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.46,0:14:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hat's little gang would\Nhave defeated all of CP9.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.38,0:14:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So have you finally found the place\Nwhere you belong in the end? I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.52,0:14:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,know if Saul was right I don't know\Nif what I've done is right or not
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,either so now I need you to show me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the answer to that question I intend
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.82,0:14:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,to then live your life with courage
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and prove that Ohara is still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How cagey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.14,0:14:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.70,0:14:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.08,0:14:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Robin, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:14:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's me, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, could you guys grow up already?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, you were stepping\Nyour face a second ago, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope these are the friends\Nyou've been searching for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right, Saul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.14,0:15:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.82,0:15:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should try that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.36,0:15:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Robin! Do it! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.78,0:15:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a bad influence, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't encourage her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.08,0:15:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You just cooked the meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell us how to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Stars, this is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.58,0:15:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.18,0:16:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.38,0:16:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In the New World, one of the four\Nemperors has broken through our lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.50,0:16:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard, Edward Newgate has\Ncrossed paths with the second emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.06,0:16:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Red-Haired Shanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.97,0:16:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and they seem to be preparing for\Nsome sort of meeting as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.66,0:16:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Red-Haired's ship is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to have a meeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then. Let him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That little punk better have some booze\Nfor me, if he knows what's good for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He really broke through the entire fleet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.02,0:16:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Red hair and white beard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.88,0:16:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,From this point forward, we\Ndon't know what might happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All men, stand by on high alert! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.48,0:16:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.36,0:16:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the sails!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.53,0:17:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Red hair is now boarding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.04,0:17:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.06,0:17:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you newcomers should stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.34,0:17:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean we'll be knocked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, don't ask. Just go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.68,0:17:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you all falling over?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned you, or I tried to at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.20,0:17:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad, Marco.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.74,0:17:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.65,0:17:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just passing out, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.58,0:17:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who have a weak\Nwill cannot withstand
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.00,0:17:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the aura that surrounds\Nthat man's every step.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.72,0:18:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of his Haki is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You must excuse me. It's\Nhard to stay calm when
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on an enemy ship just\Nlooking at your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes the scar that bastard\Ngave me ache all over
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,again then can I interest\Nyou in some of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine medicinal water I\Nbrought I came here to talk
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,not to fight you knock\Nout half my boys with Your
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.08,0:18:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Haki than you offer me a\Ndrink you got balls kid
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,he ain't kidding red Hair\Nlook at this mess you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.94,0:18:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah you're Markov the first division huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.48,0:18:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you want a drink too\Nhow about you go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.36,0:18:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey pops you want us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah. It's fine. He knows better\Nthan to pick a fight with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.46,0:18:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.34,0:19:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sake from West Blue, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Never knew you were such a cheapskate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I've sailed all\Nthe way around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm telling you, the first drink I\Never had still tastes the best to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.92,0:19:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a specialty for my hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger, Garp, Sengoku,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.62,0:19:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,there aren't many left who remember\Nthe ocean the way it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.32,0:19:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been 22 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.18,0:19:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made quite a leap\Nsince then, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.78,0:19:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember when you were just an\Napprentice on Goldie Roger's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:20:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger and I locked horns so\Nmany times back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.14,0:20:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,After a while, I started to\Nremember all the faces on his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.80,0:20:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, White Beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.78,0:20:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to be Red Beard\Nwhen I'm done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.32,0:20:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your beard is going to\Nbe dyed red with your own blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.82,0:20:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, that one sounded\Na lot better in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happened to that red-nosed kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't seem too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.98,0:20:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he wind up dead or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Buggy, that brings me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.24,0:20:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When the captain was executed,\Nhe and I parted ways at Log Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Never met again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.18,0:20:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can join my crew, Buggy. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.16,0:20:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.30,0:20:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I'd work under you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd heard rumors that he's still a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.60,0:20:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.76,0:20:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The young ones may forget, but\Nit's still fresh in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.32,0:20:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No one talks about the old\Nlegends anymore these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But if they'd seen your duel\Nwith Hawkeye like I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,they'd be yapping about\Nit till the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:20:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Still,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.49,0:20:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,when you came back from\NEast Blue missing an arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You better believe the rumors were flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.06,0:21:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I was pretty curious myself
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can ask you face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.02,0:21:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What enemy did you give that left arm to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.58,0:21:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This huh, I wouldn't take you with me\Nanyway, you'll never make it as a pirate
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.54,0:21:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the greatest treasure in the world,\Nand then I'll be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.28,0:21:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say I made a bet on a new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.46,0:21:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have no regrets, then it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.48,0:21:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Whitebeard, I've\Nfought countless battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.32,0:21:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've received countless scars as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.38,0:21:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But the only one that's aching\Nright now is this one right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.22,0:22:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.13,0:22:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This one came from someone\Nwho was on your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.14,0:22:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard. Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.70,0:22:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And this didn't happen because\NI was being careless either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.26,0:22:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You know exactly what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.06,0:22:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.96,0:22:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He laid low and waited for his chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He never became a squad leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.14,0:22:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He never tried to make a name for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.52,0:22:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All he did was hide himself\Nbehind your giant shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.58,0:22:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And once he had enough power,\Nhe finally made his move.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.48,0:22:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A man like that will never be satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.54,0:22:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll use all of his will\Nin order to reach the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.36,0:22:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means he'll\Ncome after you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.36,0:22:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get to the point already?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.10,0:22:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.14,0:22:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to stop Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.50,0:23:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's young, and he's more than good enough\Nto be the leader of the second division.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.30,0:23:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong, I\Nknow how strong he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.30,0:23:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, no matter how much you trust\Nhim, I think this is a big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.80,0:23:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is simply not the time for\Nthose two to go head-to-head.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.12,0:23:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to keep your\Ndistance from Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.94,0:23:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I came here to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.14,0:23:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.20,0:23:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.30,0:23:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You snot-nosed brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.18,0:23:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what you're asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.14,0:23:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach murdered one of my\Ncrewmates, one of his crewmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.24,0:23:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the one rule that\Ncan never be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.28,0:23:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Every pirate in the world knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.94,0:23:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,When a pirate joins my crew,\Nno matter how stupid they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.22,0:23:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,they become like a son to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.90,0:24:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So what am I to say to the\Nsoul of my murdered child?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.94,0:24:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't live in this world\Nwithout a code of conduct.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.16,0:24:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If Teach doesn't realize that on his own,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.00,0:24:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,then it's my responsibility to\Ndrill it into his thick head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.28,0:24:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a hundred years too\Nyoung to boss me around, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.68,0:24:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have I made myself perfectly clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.40,0:24:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this era will spiral into chaos,\Nand no one will be able to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.80,0:24:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to frighten me, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.78,0:24:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.86,0:24:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.77,0:24:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.92,0:25:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should go help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.60,0:25:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.94,0:25:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Red hair ain't stupid enough\Nto start a fight here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.08,0:25:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,True, but either way, it looks\Nlike their talk has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.36,0:25:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.78,0:25:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The clouds know the heavens\Nthemselves have been divided.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.50,0:25:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.94,0:25:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Iceberg's here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.46,0:25:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.82,0:25:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're really doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.80,0:25:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.98,0:25:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to fight about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.22,0:25:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.24,0:25:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but if you'd like, I can help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.32,0:25:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.66,0:25:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're probably just here\Nto mess with my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.46,0:25:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been dismantling so long,\NI'm afraid your skills have dulled.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.42,0:25:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me your blueprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.00,0:25:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A reunion for Tom's workers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.22,0:25:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you old pros have\Nroom for a couple of rookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.36,0:25:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.27,0:25:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Galley Law Company is ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.60,0:26:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's build the Straw Hats of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.48,0:26:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They're probably itching\Nto get off this island,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.38,0:26:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,so we figured you could use a little help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.84,0:26:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I thought you\Nwere repairing the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.08,0:26:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.99,0:26:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We were, but when we heard you were\Nbuilding a new ship for the Straw Hats,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.04,0:26:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone packed up their stuff and\Nran here as fast as they could.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.60,0:26:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.92,0:26:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm happy to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.32,0:26:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They really touched my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.50,0:26:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.34,0:26:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hop to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.50,0:26:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No slack at all! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.68,0:26:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.59,0:26:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's show them what the Doc\Nwon for them and I made them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.36,0:26:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.70,0:26:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's today's newspaper.\NThey have a big report on Annie's.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.28,0:26:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,lobby come on don't leave us hanging\Nquick tell us what it says that
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.44,0:26:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,article is going to decide all\Nour fates well about that Yeah go
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.18,0:27:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,on there's nothing much to say\Nreally it doesn't mention us at all
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.68,0:27:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Really not a single word.\NNope, we're saved. I
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.04,0:27:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,thought i was gonna have\Nto live the rest of my
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.76,0:27:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Life as a fugitive
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.10,0:27:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that crazy bastard get a
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.22,0:27:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,load of this it's about\NStraw Hat he and his crew
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.32,0:27:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,went Wild on Enies Lobby\Nhis bounty should go
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.94,0:27:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,through the roof after\Nthat one that's next to
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.64,0:27:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Water 7 Yes i wonder\Nif they hijacked a sea
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.20,0:27:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,train to get there that\Nisland isn't far from here
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.86,0:27:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate we might meet them\Nagain if fate is kind enough to
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.24,0:27:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,place him in our sights We're\Nobligated to pull the trigger aren't we
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.02,0:27:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for nothing let's go?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.04,0:28:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better cut them off before they leave,\Nor before the Navy gets to them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.28,0:28:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on a second there, Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.18,0:28:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to talk. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.22,0:28:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days before the Straw Hat\NPirates' new bounties shocked the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.12,0:28:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,another history-changing of it was\Nabout to occur not far from Water 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.98,0:28:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.44,0:28:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Franky family really\Nwrecked up the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.18,0:28:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe your grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.78,0:28:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you pulled some strings and told the
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.66,0:28:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,government that they were\Njust innocent bystanders?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.86,0:28:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, that's too complicated for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.76,0:28:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what Luffy said!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.90,0:28:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be Aokiji's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.98,0:28:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.56,0:28:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, that's good for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.98,0:29:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, we're criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.62,0:29:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But I would hate to see\Nanyone get wrapped up
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.94,0:29:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,in this mess and have\Ntheir whole lives ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.10,0:29:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, good thing you feel that way,\Nbecause they had plenty to say about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.72,0:29:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A declaration of war on\Nthe world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.66,0:29:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They even blame us for\Nburning down the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.20,0:29:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I guarantee our bounties are going to\Ngo through the roof after this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.84,0:29:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, does that mean\NI'll finally get a bounty?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.96,0:29:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe, you'll probably get something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.56,0:29:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But mine's gonna be the big one this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.92,0:29:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright star appears, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.96,0:29:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you excited about?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.12,0:29:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankie's building us a ship and\Nwe don't even have to pay for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.08,0:29:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, you were asleep\Nwhen he said that. Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.34,0:29:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Frankie's not a jerk after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.52,0:29:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankie's a nice guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.78,0:29:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see how it turns out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.84,0:29:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.75,0:29:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can use the rest of our money\Nto buy supplies for the voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.84,0:29:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope this one's equipped\Nwith a weight room.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.20,0:29:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to our 100 million berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.48,0:29:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.39,0:30:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I already spent it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.42,0:30:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We needed to buy lots of\Nmeat and booze for the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.62,0:30:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You spent all of my money?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.58,0:30:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, everyone was really hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.34,0:30:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you spend so much on food?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.36,0:30:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's hardly anything left.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.76,0:30:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course there isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.76,0:30:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole town was partying with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.50,0:30:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and they didn't go home\Nuntil morning, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.82,0:30:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure was fun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.06,0:30:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the ship's free, we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.42,0:30:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So no worries, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.32,0:30:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted nice\Nfurniture for this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.24,0:30:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.54,0:30:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We can still check out the resale shops.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.98,0:30:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can I have some of\Nthat money to go play with?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.74,0:30:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd sooner take it to the grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.74,0:30:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your allowance is revoked!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.12,0:30:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.34,0:31:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.42,0:31:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.60,0:31:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.51,0:31:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to rejoin your crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.70,0:31:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you well?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.94,0:31:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.90,0:31:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be rough without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.04,0:31:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm not around, things really\Nstart to fall apart, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.00,0:31:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.32,0:31:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you insist, I'll rejoin\Nthe Straw Hat pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.12,0:31:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that does seem to be\Nthe best way to go about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.58,0:31:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And that makes 23 scenarios.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.60,0:31:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.18,0:31:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice weather we're having, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.74,0:31:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.72,0:31:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.63,0:31:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Loopy, care to join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.60,0:31:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.94,0:31:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's always the\Njust pretend like nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.56,0:31:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,happened and hop on\Nboard the ship strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.82,0:31:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.92,0:31:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided to set out on\Nmy own and visit Elbath.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.70,0:31:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.86,0:31:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.20,0:31:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.12,0:32:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally understand not wanting\Nto live your lives without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.52,0:32:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So does that mean you're\Nstaying? Who's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.70,0:32:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I will, dummies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.04,0:32:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I didn't know anybody could love\Nsomeone as much as you guys You guys love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.48,0:32:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's he doing? What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.80,0:32:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, ice for brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.44,0:32:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're getting tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.74,0:32:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a beauty nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.10,0:32:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.48,0:32:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.54,0:32:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.62,0:32:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still alive, but at this\Nrate, I won't be for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.66,0:32:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.64,0:32:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,An abandoned ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.60,0:32:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Full of.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.60,0:33:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Broken wood and scrap iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.44,0:33:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.22,0:33:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I fit right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.16,0:33:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta do something about\Nthis useless body of mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.82,0:33:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.08,0:33:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally set.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.88,0:33:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the Log Pose is\Npointing to the next island.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.94,0:33:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left is to get our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.16,0:33:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.54,0:33:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see the ship myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.36,0:33:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But Franky said no peeking\Nuntil he's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.90,0:33:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, guys, you know\Nwhere that log is pointing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.80,0:33:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Might come as a big surprise\Nif you're not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.30,0:33:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I don't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.48,0:33:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, it kind of\Nlooks like it's pointing down a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.60,0:33:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.30,0:33:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Because where it's pointing\Nis on the bottom of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.38,0:33:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.44,0:34:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.58,0:34:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're finally going to\NFishman Island? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.52,0:34:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Sanji's acting weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.34,0:34:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.26,0:34:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.62,0:34:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.96,0:34:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that going to be tough after\Nwhat happened in your village?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.32,0:34:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They were pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.74,0:34:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not all fishmen are going to\Ngive us trouble like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.96,0:34:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.87,0:34:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody knows Fishman Island is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.74,0:34:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Zoro, and he's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.82,0:34:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island is one of the most\Nfamous spots on the whole Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.18,0:34:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful mermaids leap and dive, painting\Nthe water with their elegant tailpits.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.90,0:34:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There you can frolic with the fish\Nand make all your dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.54,0:34:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help, Luffy, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.24,0:34:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.26,0:34:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.04,0:34:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.56,0:34:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I'm not hurting anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.28,0:34:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, there's Young Mermaids, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.24,0:34:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, even if the\Nplace is nice to visit,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.94,0:34:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,that don't mean it's easy\Nfor people to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.12,0:34:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume that was the case, since\Nit's at the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.28,0:35:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, we'll figure it out on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.92,0:35:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, on the way is a problem, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.24,0:35:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at today's paper\Nand you'll understand, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.08,0:35:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.00,0:35:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,14 ships have disappeared this\Nmonth alone, all in the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.00,0:35:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.96,0:35:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They call that patch of\Nwater the Florian Triangle.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.04,0:35:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,anyways,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.36,0:35:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't be making it to Fishman Island\Nuntil after you sail through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.22,0:35:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Every year,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.04,0:35:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,over 100 ships go missing in that\Narea and nobody has a clue as to why.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.88,0:35:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's spooky is that later they show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.80,0:35:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,totally empty, without a\Nsingle crew member in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.64,0:35:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Other people say they found ghost ships\Nwith crews of dead men wandering the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.20,0:35:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,lost in a haze.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.60,0:35:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean they're like zombies?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.22,0:35:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary hanging out with a bunch\Nof skeletons. Sounds cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.14,0:35:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanging out that's some\Nimagination you've got. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.40,0:35:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No ghost ships for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.80,0:35:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.82,0:36:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're passing straight through that place!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.48,0:36:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what really happens in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.40,0:36:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.76,0:36:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, nobody ever comes out of\Nthere alive, and dead men tell no tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.74,0:36:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.06,0:36:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The water is dark, the fog\Nis thick, it swallows you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.72,0:36:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Many a soul has been sacrificed\Nto that treacherous sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.66,0:36:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,so you better be darn ready before\Nyou even think of setting sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.44,0:36:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Although some people do\Ncall them ghost ships,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.78,0:36:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,abandoned vessels are often\Ncalled treasure ships, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.04,0:36:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're more likely to find a ship\Nfilled with riches than the undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.08,0:36:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but turn down those ghost ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.26,0:36:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.92,0:36:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but I don't want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.14,0:36:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stock up on plenty of\Nfood and water before we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.98,0:36:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so even if we do get lost, we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.70,0:36:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A treasure ship, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.24,0:36:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they have swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.76,0:36:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pirate people!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.10,0:36:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.42,0:36:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.94,0:37:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky wants to talk to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.02,0:37:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got something big to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.24,0:37:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long night, but they\Nfinished his ship of dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.62,0:37:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And boy, is it super cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.20,0:37:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.58,0:37:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it's done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.50,0:37:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That was really fast! Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.74,0:37:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when the best shipwrights\Nin the world work around the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.32,0:37:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You better believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.48,0:37:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.46,0:37:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.82,0:37:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawheads!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.98,0:37:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We got bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.06,0:37:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.94,0:37:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.20,0:37:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They look upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.34,0:37:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.06,0:37:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, we just found\Nout about this ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.26,0:37:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen the wanted posters?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.78,0:37:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanted posters?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.94,0:37:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a huge bounty\Non your head, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.08,0:37:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to hunt you down for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.42,0:37:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, you've all got bounties.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.38,0:37:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole crew is wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.42,0:37:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Took long enough. How much? Not me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.06,0:37:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.97,0:37:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No point in talking. Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.12,0:38:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanted posters for all seven of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.32,0:38:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy with a bounty\Nof 300 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.82,0:38:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! It went up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.52,0:38:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirate Hunter Zoro with a\Nbounty of 120 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.00,0:38:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.92,0:38:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cat Burglar Nami with a\Nbounty of 16 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.12,0:38:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.52,0:38:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Cotton Candy Lovin' Chopper,\NPet with a bounty of 50 berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.34,0:38:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,50?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.82,0:38:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon Child Robin with a\Nbounty of 80 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.70,0:38:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.36,0:38:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Leg Sanji, attempt\Nto take a photo failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.70,0:38:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bounty, 77 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.34,0:38:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, Sniper King\Nhas one too, only 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.74,0:39:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I know that this is\Nprobably big news for you and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.08,0:39:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure there's a lot of\Npirate stuff you want to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.80,0:39:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But, uh, hold on a sec, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.46,0:39:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here because I got\Na favor to ask of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.22,0:39:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.76,0:39:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.08,0:39:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyborg Franky, with a bounty\Nof 44 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.08,0:39:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.04,0:39:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro's wanted by the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.12,0:39:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.50,0:39:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.08,0:39:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I was happy when I found\Nout we didn't have bounties.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.82,0:39:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But then this had to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.76,0:39:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the whole\Ncity knows about our bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.16,0:39:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't stay in Water 7 anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.90,0:39:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he gets arrested again,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.60,0:39:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we'll have the power\Nto save him like we did last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.44,0:39:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure he worried about us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.36,0:39:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,knowing him he probably wouldn't\Nleave the island no matter how much
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.00,0:39:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we begged him that's why we came to\Nyou we have no other choice we're
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.10,0:39:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,begging you here Straw Hats even if\Nhe tries to fight you gotta take our
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.84,0:39:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,bro out to sea with you come on his\Nparents were pirates it's in his blood
